# Local working notes only — everything else in this private repo stays tracked.
CLAUDE.md
CODEX_CHANGELOG.md
.claude/

# Generated by tools/i18n-extract.mjs --write; PANEL_STRINGS in src/ is the committed source.
tools/i18n-manifest.json

# Release artifacts. `npm run verify` rebuilds these on every commit that touches src/, so tracking
# them added ~3.9 MB of incompressible binary per commit -- 230 blobs and 277.9 MB of the pack by
# 2026-08-15. They are produced at release time and attached to the release, not carried in history.
# dist/aviary.user.js stays tracked: @downloadURL resolves to it, so it IS the update channel.
dist/extension-*-v*.zip
# The unpacked bundles for the same reason: `content.js` alone is 1.9 MB per target, rebuilt by
# `npm run verify` on every commit touching src/, and nothing consumes the committed copy -- both
# INSTALL's load-unpacked steps and the release artifacts come from a build. `dist/aviary.meta.js`
# and `dist/aviary.user.js` stay tracked because a manager polls them by raw URL.
dist/extension-chrome/
dist/extension-firefox/
